{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "先问控制了什么",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 76.94,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.665
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "共识，是网络里的节点，就哪条链是正确的，达成一致的机制。",
   "spoken": "共识，是网络里的节点，就哪条链是正确的，达成一致的机制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 3.1,
   "speechEnd": 8.835
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "重组，是节点放弃已经接受的几个区块，改为接受另一条链。",
   "spoken": "虫组，是节点放弃已经接受的几个区块，改为接受另一条链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 9.24,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 9.24,
   "speechEnd": 14.59
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "已经确认的交易，会在重组里消失。",
   "spoken": "已经确认的交易，会在虫组里消失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 14.98,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 15.076,
   "speechEnd": 17.607
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "所以交易所说的已确认，只是对这条链安全假设的一个赌注。",
   "spoken": "所以交易所说的已确认，只是对这条链安全假设的一个赌注。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 18.0,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 18.0,
   "speechEnd": 23.204
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 23.66,
   "dur": 0.8,
   "speechStart": 23.76,
   "speechEnd": 24.248
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "一个城市的公证处，靠多数公证员签字，确认房产交易。",
   "spoken": "一个城市的公证处，靠多数公证员签字，确认房产交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 24.68,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 24.775,
   "speechEnd": 29.08
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "如果有人临时雇来半数以上的公证员。",
   "spoken": "如果有人临时雇来半数以上的公证员。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 29.46,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 29.557,
   "speechEnd": 32.493
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "他可以让一份盖过章的合同作废，再把同一套房卖给另一个人。",
   "spoken": "他可以让一份盖过章的合同作废，再把同一套房卖给另一个人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 32.88,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 32.88,
   "speechEnd": 37.876
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "这就是双花，同一笔资产被花两次。",
   "spoken": "这就是双花，同一笔资产被花两次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 38.3,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 38.3,
   "speechEnd": 41.958
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，现实里雇公证员要花很多年。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，现实里雇公证员要花很多年。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 42.36,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 42.457,
   "speechEnd": 47.22
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "在小算力的 PoW 链上，算力可以按小时租。",
   "spoken": "在小算力的 PoW 链上，算力可以按小时租。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 47.62,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 47.62,
   "speechEnd": 52.001
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "很多人把所有共识攻击，都叫 51% 攻击。",
   "spoken": "很多人把所有共识攻击，都叫百分之 51 攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 52.4,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 52.4,
   "speechEnd": 57.102
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "这会选错防线。",
   "spoken": "这会选错防线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 57.5,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 57.593,
   "speechEnd": 59.074
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "更好的问法是，攻击者控制了什么。",
   "spoken": "更好的问法是，攻击者控制了什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 59.48,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 59.581,
   "speechEnd": 62.711
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "身份和连接、算力、单个区块的时机。",
   "spoken": "身份和连接、算力、单个区块的时机。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 63.14,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 63.14,
   "speechEnd": 67.034
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "权益或旧私钥、别人的动机，以及让链停下的份额。",
   "spoken": "权益或旧私钥、别人的动机，以及让链停下的份额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 67.44,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 67.44,
   "speechEnd": 72.709
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "控制的资源不同，防线就不同。",
   "spoken": "控制的资源不同，防线就不同。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 73.18,
